cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "emicmip"
abstract: >-
  Set of tools to convert raw CMIP6/CMIP7 emission datasets (input4MIPs NetCDF) into
  yearly per-species and per-group NetCDF files (grouped as tar files) for the
  OpenIFS/IFS emission pre-processor. The suite also allows to check and validate
  the produced datasets. It provides tested emission-specification files for
  OpenIFS CY48R1.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Checa-Garcia"
    given-names: "Ramiro"
    affiliation: "Royal Netherlands Meteorological Institute (KNMI)"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0001-7653-3653"
version: "0.2.0"
date-released: "2026-10-17"
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/rchg/emicmip"
url: "https://rchg.github.io/emicmip/"
keywords:
  - emissions
  - CMIP7
  - CMIP6
  - input4MIPs
  - OpenIFS
  - IFS
  - climate-model
